{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以西结书","commonName":"以西结书","title":"以西结书","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"aa1b925988838e1371bb072e339379f03dcec5f83d41111f9f14f58e31d5e89e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1270},"chapter":{"number":30,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华要惩罚埃及"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华的话又临到我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「人子啊，你要发预言说，主耶和华如此说：",{"text":"哀哉这日！你们应当哭号。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华的日子临近，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是密云之日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列国受罚之期。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必有刀剑临到埃及；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在埃及被杀之人仆倒的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"古实人就有痛苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人民必被掳掠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"基址必被拆毁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["古实人、弗人",{"noteId":29},"、路德人、杂族的人民，并古巴人，以及同盟之地的人都要与埃及人一同倒在刀下。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"扶助埃及的也必倾倒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及因势力而有的骄傲必降低微；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中的人民，从色弗尼塔起","poem":1},{"noteId":30},{"text":"必倒在刀下。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是主耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及地在荒凉的国中必成为荒凉；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及城在荒废的城中也变为荒废。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在埃及中使火着起；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"帮助埃及的，都被灭绝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，他们就知道我是耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["「到那日，必有使者坐船，从我面前出去，使安逸无虑的古实人惊惧；必有痛苦临到他们，好像埃及遭灾的日子一样。看哪，这事临近了！"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"主耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必借巴比伦王尼布甲尼撒的手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除灭埃及众人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他和随从他的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是列国中强暴的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必进来毁灭这地。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必拔刀攻击埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使遍地有被杀的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使江河干涸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将地卖在恶人的手中；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必借外邦人的手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使这地和其中所有的变为凄凉。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是我—耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"主耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必毁灭偶像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从挪弗除灭神像；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必不再有君王出自埃及地。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使埃及地的人惧怕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使巴忒罗荒凉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在琐安中使火着起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向挪施行审判。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必将我的忿怒倒在埃及的保障上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是训上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并要剪除挪的众人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必在埃及中使火着起；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"训必大大痛苦；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挪必被攻破；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挪弗白日","poem":1},{"noteId":31},{"text":"见仇敌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亚文和比伯实的少年人必倒在刀下；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这些城的人必被掳掠。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在答比匿折断埃及的诸轭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使她因势力而有的骄傲在其中止息。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，日光必退去；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至于这城，必有密云遮蔽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中的女子必被掳掠。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必这样向埃及施行审判，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们就知道我是耶和华。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["埃及王破碎的力量"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["十一年正月初七日，耶和华的话临到我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["「人子啊，我已打折埃及王法老的膀臂；没有敷药，也没有用布缠好，使他有力持刀。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["所以主耶和华如此说：看哪，我与埃及王法老为敌，必将他有力的膀臂和已打折的膀臂全行打断，使刀从他手中坠落。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["我必将埃及人分散在列国，四散在列邦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["我必使巴比伦王的膀臂有力，将我的刀交在他手中；却要打断法老的膀臂，他就在巴比伦王面前唉哼，如同受死伤的人一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["我必扶持巴比伦王的膀臂，法老的膀臂却要下垂；我将我的刀交在巴比伦王手中，他必举刀攻击埃及地，他们就知道我是耶和华。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["我必将埃及人分散在列国，四散在列邦；他们就知道我是耶和华。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":29,"caller":"-","text":"或译：利比亚","reference":{"chapter":30,"verse":5}},{"noteId":30,"caller":"-","text":"见二十九章十节","reference":{"chapter":30,"verse":6}},{"noteId":31,"caller":"-","text":"或译：终日","reference":{"chapter":30,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/30.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/31.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/29.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":26}